{"reviewId": "391091287_8c7nly9vJ", "review": {"abstract": ")一个超级周期内部存在三个显著的小级别周期波动规律，类比厄尔尼诺以及涛动指数循环现象，我们称其为大宗商品的涛动周期。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "chapterUid": 18, "content": "​​周期嵌套关系图示​​\n康波周期（40-60年）\n├─ 产能周期1（25-30年） \n│   ├─ 超级周期1（18-20年） \n│   │   ├─ 涛动周期1 \n│   │   ├─ 涛动周期2 \n│   │   └─ 涛动周期3 \n│   └─ 超级周期2（18-20年） \n├─ 产能周期2（25-30年） \n│   └─ 超级周期3（18-20年） \n│       ├─ 涛动周期4 \n│       ├─ 涛动周期5 \n│       └─ 涛动周期6 \n\n​​其他周期补充​​\n• ​​房地产周期​​：与超级周期强相关（1960年前跟随美国，1960年后跟随日本/中国）。\n• ​​库存周期（基钦周期）​​：3-4年，嵌套在产能周期中，影响短期波动（如2023-2024年库存周期下行）。\n• ​​黄金价格​​：中期与大宗商品产能周期同步（产能上升期金价上涨，下降期震荡走低）。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "6314-6372", "createTime": 1789399211, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 18, "reviewId": "391091287_8c7nly9vJ", "userVid": 391091287, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "author": {"userVid": 391091287, "name": "舟", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0003-OG8szFi8Qwzlq7zelpEVdc8/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "舟", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-100", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 2, "likes": [{"userVid": 82730783, "name": "钝初", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/LpkTo1p2nm0BJCpCqicycmtaCP1bhGwiaydthFyddvzUCDKFhpawk1qrRMurnxPa7J5cbd92TPrbF6BZL9kicW0MQ/132", "isFollowing": 0